							"left": 16,
							"top": 16,
							"width": 296,
							"height": 112,
							"text": "What this shows. DAO Data Access Object is the only place that talks to the SQL database. GenericDao defines common operations. Each entity has its own DAO interface that extends GenericDao and adds specific queries. JDBC implementations talk to SQL Server via the shared Db helper and DatabaseConnection."
						}
