						"$ref": "Z6a2elUS3BDcYL6mmY4="
					},
					"name": "Description",
					"specification": "What this shows. Step-by-step computation of a portfolio risk score, with each swimlane representing a different participant. HTTP arrives at the controller, the service gathers holdings and price history via the DAO layer, the Strategy does the statistical math (log returns + standard deviation), and the value-weighted result returns to the user."
				}
			]
		}
